; DIMLINEAR, Enter at the first prompt: Select object to dimension (PT26, #713).
; A pick on empty space keeps the prompt without a message (ADR 0032, point 1);
; a LINE gives its endpoints as origins, a segment of an LWPOLYLINE the
; endpoints of that segment, in vertex order. Values by hand from PT23 with
; ISO-25, as in dimlinear/punti-direzione-automatica (six graphics records
; numbered after each dimension).
LINE
0,0
30,40

PLINE
50,0
80,0
80,20

DIMLINEAR

200,200
!report
15,20
-10,20
DIMLINEAR

80,10
90,10
